-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
STUB PLACEHOLDER - NOT A REAL CERTIFICATE
This file stands in for SwitchNet's actual root CA certificate. It is not
valid PEM/DER data and will be rejected by anything that tries to parse it
as a certificate - that's intentional, so an unreplaced stub fails safely
instead of silently appearing to work.

Replace this file with SwitchNet's real root CA certificate (PEM format)
before relying on certificate trust in the field. See certs.c for every
place this file gets installed to.
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
